    @CleanupRestoreNetwork
    Scenario Outline: Unsubscribe requests during network failure result in client error
        Given HeadlessApp subscribe the sensor signal <path> which is initialized <value> of datatype <datatype>
        When network failure of <network_failure> is injected
        Then attempts to unsubscribe the subscription to <path> of <datatype> are failed

    Examples:
        | path                                          | network_failure | datatype  | value     |
        | Vehicle.Body.Hood.IsLocked | reject  | bool | false |
        | Vehicle.Body.Hood.IsLocked | timeout | bool | false |
        | Vehicle.Body.Hood.IsOpen | reject  | bool | false |
        | Vehicle.Body.Hood.IsOpen | timeout | bool | false |
        | Vehicle.Body.Hood.Position | reject  | uint8 | 50 |
        | Vehicle.Body.Hood.Position | timeout | uint8 | 50 |
        | Vehicle.Body.Horn.IsActive | reject  | bool | false |
        | Vehicle.Body.Horn.IsActive | timeout | bool | false |
        | Vehicle.Body.IsAutoPowerOptimize | reject  | bool | false |
        | Vehicle.Body.IsAutoPowerOptimize | timeout | bool | false |
        | Vehicle.Body.Lights.Backup.IsDefect | reject  | bool | false |
        | Vehicle.Body.Lights.Backup.IsDefect | timeout | bool | false |
        | Vehicle.Body.Lights.Backup.IsOn | reject  | bool | false |
        | Vehicle.Body.Lights.Backup.IsOn | timeout | bool | false |
        | Vehicle.Body.Lights.Beam.High.IsDefect | reject  | bool | false |
        | Vehicle.Body.Lights.Beam.High.IsDefect | timeout | bool | false |
        | Vehicle.Body.Lights.Beam.High.IsOn | reject  | bool | false |
        | Vehicle.Body.Lights.Beam.High.IsOn | timeout | bool | false |
        | Vehicle.Body.Lights.Beam.Low.IsDefect | reject  | bool | false |
        | Vehicle.Body.Lights.Beam.Low.IsDefect | timeout | bool | false |
        | Vehicle.Body.Lights.Beam.Low.IsOn | reject  | bool | false |
        | Vehicle.Body.Lights.Beam.Low.IsOn | timeout | bool | false |
        | Vehicle.Body.Lights.Brake.IsActive | reject  | string | ACTIVE |
